00:07:57,142 --> 00:08:03,142
Edward Wilson believed in America, and he would
sacrifice everything he loved to protect it.

2
00:15:54,285 --> 00:16:00,285
The Good Shepherd is a drama, thriller, history film directed by Robert De Niro.

3
00:23:51,428 --> 00:23:57,428
Edward Wilson, the only witness to his father's suicide and member of the Skull and Bones Society while a student at Yale, is a morally
upright young man who values honor and discretion, qualities that help him to be recruited for a career in the newly founded OSS.

4
00:31:48,571 --> 00:31:54,571
His dedication to his work does not come without a price though, leading
him to sacrifice his ideals and eventually his family.

5
